# Root build context for apps/api, apps/web and apps/broker images (docker build -f apps/<app>/Dockerfile .)
# The broker has its own Prisma schema (apps/broker/prisma); the API image also generates the broker
# client (it imports @cimcms/broker/prisma), so keep apps/broker in the context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Generated Prisma clients are regenerated inside the image (host engines would be wrong/large).
**/src/generated
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local
infra/dev
infra/server-*
docs
tools/**
!tools/*/package.json
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
